# 6. ⏰ Time Blocking

Once you know your ONE Thing, **reserve time for it**.

Don't simply say:

> "I'll do DSA sometime today."

Instead:

```text
8:00 – 9:00
        ↓
DSA — ONE Thing

9:00 – 9:15
        ↓
Break

9:15 – 10:00
        ↓
Core CS
```

The important work gets protected time.

The official book description emphasizes staying on track and achieving better results in less time. ([The ONE Thing][1])

