# 13. 🧘 Balance vs Priority

This is an especially useful concept.

You may have:

* academics
* placement preparation
* projects
* fitness
* family
* friends
* reading
* personal development

You cannot always give each area equal attention every day.

Instead:

### Work life

**Counterbalance:** don't allow work to consume everything.

### Personal priorities

**Prioritize:** give the current most important area the attention it needs.

So:

> **Don't seek perfect balance every hour. Seek appropriate priority over time.**

